<title>UK: LME copper dips in AM ring, others soft.</title>
<headline>LME copper dips in AM ring, others soft.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Softer, settles at $2,336 lows. Spreads come in slightly, cash/threes at $60/$65 vs $75/$80.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Drifts lower, testing support from $1,620 to $1,614.</p>
<p>ZINC - Probes $1,255 support. LEAD - Weaker.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Edges under $7,300.</p>
<p>TIN - Stabilises above $5,700. ALLOY - Off with primary.</p>
</text>
